&lt;p&gt;Product Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK (remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reachdesk is the first truly end-to-end global SaaS gifting and swag platform, helping B2B companies create meaningful connections with prospects, customers, and employees, while driving measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe gifting is more than just a transaction: it’s about building genuine human connections that fuel business growth. Whether it’s engaging prospects, celebrating customers, or recognizing employees, our platform makes it easy to deliver personalized gifts, branded swag, and unforgettable event &amp;amp; brand experiences at scale through automated sourcing, storage, and global delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by many of the most recognized names in technology and SaaS, Reachdesk integrates effortlessly with marketing, sales, and HRIS tech stacks and is powered by our world-class team across New York, London, and Lisbon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re growing, and we’re currently looking for a Product Manager to join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Reachdesk, you’ll play a pivotal role in shaping the Reachdesk Platform. You will be accountable for turning complex customer and business problems into software products that deliver measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Chief Product Officer, you’ll lead product initiatives end-to-end,&amp;nbsp; from identifying and deeply understanding the right problems to solve, through discovery and delivery, to launch, adoption, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll operate with a high degree of autonomy, proactively building context across customers, the market, internal stakeholders, data, and technology to understand what Reachdesk needs to achieve its goals. You’ll also make sound decisions when the path forward isn’t obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Engineering and Design and work across the wider business to create alignment, communicate decisions clearly, and ensure what we build is successfully launched, adopted, and delivers the outcomes we set out to achieve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy solving difficult problems, taking ownership, and moving comfortably between customer, technical, and business conversations, you’ll thrive in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set product direction and priorities&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing together company goals, internal stakeholder needs, customer insight, market context, data, and technical considerations to focus on the highest-impact opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define problems and experiences before solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, creating clear stories, journeys, and shared context so the Design and Engineering teams understand the problem and intended outcomes before determining the solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead product initiatives end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;, from discovery and solution definition through delivery, rollout, and iteration, partnering with Engineering to manage scope, make pragmatic trade-offs, and deliver valuable solutions at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make sound product decisions and trade-offs&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing customer and business needs, commercial impact, user experience, and technical considerations while aligning the wider business on compromises, priorities, and expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop product opportunities with external partners&lt;/strong&gt;, building relationships with technology partners to uncover mutual opportunities, shape integrations, align roadmaps, and navigate the product and commercial considerations required to bring them to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate successful launches and adoption&lt;/strong&gt;, working across Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, Services, Logistics, Finance, Legal, and other teams to ensure the business is ready and customers realise value from what we build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate with clarity throughout&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring leadership and teams across Reachdesk understand product decisions, progress, risks, changes, and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong track record of &lt;strong&gt;owning B2B SaaS products end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;, from identifying the right problems through delivery, adoption, and measurable customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a &lt;strong&gt;strong problem solver&lt;/strong&gt; who gets to the root of complex problems, brings structure to ambiguity, and uses evidence and judgement to determine the right path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with &lt;strong&gt;independence and initiative&lt;/strong&gt;: you seek out the customers, stakeholders, data, and context you need rather than waiting for direction, while staying anchored to Reachdesk’s goals and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;strong business and commercial awareness&lt;/strong&gt; and are curious about how the wider company operates, allowing you to understand competing needs and make pragmatic decisions beyond the boundaries of Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re &lt;strong&gt;technically fluent enough to work effectively with Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, understand systems, integrations, and constraints, ask the right questions, and contribute meaningfully to solution and scope decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an &lt;strong&gt;exceptional communicator&lt;/strong&gt;, able to create clarity, influence decisions, surface difficult trade-offs, and adapt how you communicate across customers, engineers, leadership, and teams throughout the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable &lt;strong&gt;operating externally as well as internally&lt;/strong&gt;, building productive relationships with technology partners, uncovering shared opportunities, influencing without authority, and navigating product, technical, and commercial conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong sense of &lt;strong&gt;product and user experience&lt;/strong&gt;, caring about the coherence and quality of the complete experience rather than whether individual requirements or features have simply been delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary with generous stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension with employer contributions (NEST)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Affordable Private Medical Insurance, including mental health support and fast access to care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO that increases the longer you’re with us, plus extra flexibility for life’s unexpected moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely collaborative culture with innovative, fun, and ambitious people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reachdesk believes that a diverse team helps us achieve our mission faster, and so we welcome applicants from all backgrounds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Privacy Policy: We process personal information submitted as part of your application in accordance with the Reachdesk Candidate Privacy Notice. Please review Reachdesk’s Privacy Policy here: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.reachdesk.com/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;www.reachdesk.com/candidate-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Scrum Master to join our team in London. Our products help the world&#39;s top teams and athletes perform at their best. We need an experienced Agile leader to help the squads building them do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior ScrumMaster, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach the system, not just the team.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll guide squads toward high autonomy while focusing on broader organizational design issues, such as resolving friction across business units, managing dependencies, and establishing scaling patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect outcomes, not processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll move fluidly across frameworks, adapting events to what the team needs to deliver value. You will act as an outcome architect, designing information flow and decision rhythms rather than functioning as a framework fundamentalist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipate, not react.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll utilize predictive delivery intelligence and cross-team dependency mapping to resolve impediments before they surface, keeping coordination moving in the right direction even as the pace of delivery accelerates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster psychological safety.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll build environments where candor is safe, failure is treated as a data point, and conflict is constructive. You&#39;ll ensure teams feel secure enough to take on hard problems and navigate the shifting dynamics brought on by AI-assisted development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align and design for visibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll map value streams to see where decisions stall and design cross-BU communication layers. You will maintain the signal through the noise, ensuring stakeholders know what&#39;s changed and what decisions are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of our London office. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An experienced Agile practitioner. &lt;/strong&gt;You have three or more years as a Scrum Master and have guided squads to improved, sustainable results and can scale your coaching capacity to influence broader organizational maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A systems thinker.&lt;/strong&gt; You see beyond the squad level, actively identifying and breaking down siloed organizational designs to reduce friction and eliminate duplicated efforts across Business Units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven and predictive. &lt;/strong&gt;You know how to use both qualitative and quantitative signals to establish predictive metrics that forecast delivery risk and guide investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; You design lightweight operating guardrails and information flows that keep dependencies transparent and align stakeholders at every level without creating overhead that slows teams down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A champion of responsible speed.&lt;/strong&gt; You optimize for quality, anticipated dependencies, commitments kept, and team sustainability, ensuring that the speed of code generation never outpaces our coordination speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You have an interest in or experience with AI-assisted development tools and AI-powered agile tools, such as automated bottleneck detection or real-time sentiment and health monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A diverse Agile toolbelt. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re familiar with multiple frameworks (Kanban, Lean, SAFe, etc) and know when and how to blend them for better outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global team experience. &lt;/strong&gt;Our product teams span the U.S. and Europe, and you&#39;re comfortable collaborating across time zones and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing.&lt;/strong&gt; Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£48,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£80,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anduril Australia delivers advanced maritime capability to the Royal Australian Navy and our allied partners. Our maritime programs are among the most significant and closely watched capability efforts in Australian Defence, and they are moving into operational service at a pace the sector has not seen before.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As Director, Program Management, you will lead a critical program for Anduril Australia and our Maritime division through disciplined execution, introduction into service and continuous capability development. You will own cost, schedule, risk and performance outcomes, and you will be the senior relationship lead for Navy, Defence and Government stakeholders. Working hand-in-hand with the Chief Engineer and with the engineering, operations and support teams, you will make sure capability reaches the fleet, is supported in service and keeps improving. This is an execution-focused leadership role, and stakeholder confidence matters as much as the schedule. You will both lead and execute.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and execute a large, complex, high-profile maritime program, owning delivery against contracted cost, schedule, scope and performance commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the program’s baselines, Integrated Master Schedule and resource plan (headcount, budget and facilities). Forecast accurately, identify variances early and drive recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead introduction into service. Plan and coordinate delivery, acceptance, operational test and evaluation, and transition to the operating and support organisations, working with Navy to reach initial and full operational capability milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the engineering, logistics and support teams to ensure the Fundamental Inputs to Capability are in place for service entry, including training, maintenance and support, supply, facilities and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous capability development. Manage a regular cadence of hardware and software capability increments, balance new capability against operational availability, and keep configuration management and assurance in step.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture operator and customer feedback and, with product and engineering leads, turn it into a prioritised capability roadmap that the customer understands and supports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage relationships across a complex stakeholder landscape, including Navy capability and fleet stakeholders, Defence acquisition and sustainment organisations, Government, industry partners and suppliers. Act as their trusted senior point of contact for the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain stakeholder engagement and communication plans. Lead program governance forums, steering committees and executive briefings, and manage expectations proactively, particularly when the news is difficult.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage delivery against Commonwealth contracts (including ASDEFCON-based contracts), covering milestones, contract deliverables, payments, contract change proposals, acceptance and reporting obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure crisp communication and reporting at all levels: to Anduril Australia and Maritime senior leadership, to Defence customers, to your program teams and to functional teams across Anduril globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor and grow a team of Program and Technical Program Managers. Set clear expectations and instil a high-ownership, delivery-focused culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Chief Engineer and engineering leaders to drive execution and team velocity. Understand the technical implementation well enough to make informed trade-offs and to propose alternatives when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, resolve and escalate key cross-team dependencies, including those spanning Anduril’s Australian and US teams, industry partners and suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the program meets its Defence security (DISP), export control (Australian and ITAR/EAR) and Australian Industry Capability obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve systemic execution issues. Establish lean, effective governance, processes and tools suited to a fast-moving environment, and exercise meticulous, swift follow-through on all asks and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10+ years’ experience in program and project management, including at least 5 years in senior roles such as Program Director, Senior Program Manager or Project Director leading complex defence programs through execution and into service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in Navy or military programs (as serving or former ADF personnel, within Defence, or in defence industry), with experience across maritime platforms, systems or capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience delivering complex programs with the Australian Government, including strong working knowledge of the Defence capability life cycle, introduction into service and sustainment processes, and Commonwealth contracting (ASDEFCON).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience introducing capability into service, including acceptance, operational test and evaluation, the Fundamental Inputs to Capability and transition to sustainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional stakeholder management, with a proven ability to build trust with and influence senior Navy, Defence and Government stakeholders, balance competing interests and keep their confidence through challenging program phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing cost, schedule and risk on large, technically complex programs, including resource management and integrated schedule planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading and developing teams of program and project managers, and leading cross-functional teams through influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid technical aptitude and an understanding of systems engineering, hardware and software integration, configuration management, and the associated challenges and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical familiarity with both Agile and Waterfall (phase-gated) methodologies, including managing incremental capability updates within a contracted environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, strong interpersonal skills and executive presence. Able to brief senior Defence and company leadership with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude and appetite to thrive in an organisation with nascent structure, a high-ownership culture and a “whatever it takes” environment. High ownership, low ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Sydney and willing to travel domestically and internationally (including to the US), approximately 25% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Australian citizen with the ability to obtain and maintain an NV1 security clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current NV2 security clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with autonomous systems, robotics or other advanced and emerging maritime capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with in-service support and sustainment, including integrated logistics support; reliability, availability and maintainability; and performance-based support arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running programs with continuous or spiral capability development, including software release management under Defence seaworthiness or technical regulatory frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Defence gate reviews, independent assurance reviews and capability acceptance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on international or collaborative programs, including US–Australia collaboration, AUKUS-related activity and export controls (ITAR/EAR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and quantitative skills, with the ability to use data and metrics to back up assumptions and recommendations and to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools such as Jira, Confluence, MS Project or Primavera P6.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering, Science or a related discipline. Postgraduate qualifications in project management or business, or a professional certification (e.g. AIPM, PMP, PRINCE2, MSP), are desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Horizon Software ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une Fintech spécialisée dans la conception d’une plateforme facilitant les différentes activités de trading sur les marchés financiers électroniques (automatisation de certaines activités (Market Making, Algo Trading...), gestion des ordres et exécutions de manière optimale (Agency Trading, Order and Execution Management System…),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un logiciel à la fine pointe de la technologie déployée sur site ou en SaaS,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une roadmap produit ambitieuse : Machine Learning, IA, Crypto Currencies, Low Latency…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une société à taille humaine (160 collaborateurs) où vous pouvez faire une différence,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une société internationale présente dans 6 pays pour servir des clients répartis sur 26 pays,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une société engagée : certifié B-Corp, partenaire de Planet Tech’care, Ethical IA et Lakaa, fond de dotation,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une&amp;nbsp;société reconnue et récompensée pour son expertise technologique : Best Sell-Side EMS (TradingTech Insight Awards Europe 2026), Best Sell-Side OMS (TradingTech Insight Awards Europe 2025) et Best Multi-Asset Trading System of the Year (FOW International Awards 2025).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre quotidien ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Trading Application Support Specialist&amp;nbsp;dans le cadre d’un &lt;strong&gt;stage de longue durée de 4 à 6 mois basé à Paris ou Dubai&lt;/strong&gt;, vous intégrerez une équipe de 5 personnes et vous aurez comme objectif principal d’assurer avec succès, le déploiement de nos solutions chez nos clients (brokers, banques d’investissement, places boursières...) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Etablir un contact direct avec le client tout le long du process de résolution des incidents et être le garant de la bonne utilisation du logiciel chez le client,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les incidents et définir leur niveau de criticité, selon les process et outils mis à disposition,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prendre en charge les sollicitations du client jusqu’à leur résolution ou escalade, préconisant des solutions de contournement si nécessaire,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Déployer et installer nos solutions ou des nouvelles fonctionnalités chez le client Former les clients (utilisateurs et équipes IT) à nos solutions,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partager avec les équipes Client Delivery Manager dédiées et Engineering les enjeux et attendus client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les plus de ce poste : &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler dans un environnement dynamique et stimulant techniquement et fonctionnellement,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire partie d’une équipe de Client Support talentueux et experts dans leur domaine,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoir l’opportunité de travailler sur des sujets variés dans un environnement international,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des évènements réguliers (déjeuners, afterworks, sensibilisation autour du climat...)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipe à taille humaine avec un management local et de proximité,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salaire compétitif et avantages sociaux,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding dédié et personnalisé avec un mentor pour vous accompagner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Et si c’était vous ? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé d’un BAC+5 en informatique, vous souhaitez travailler sur un poste alliant relation client et analyse technique,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous recherchez un stage de longue durée, de 4 à 6 mois,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un intérêt pour la finance de marché et le trading,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le sens du service client, d’excellentes compétences interpersonnelles, de communication et un esprit d’équipe sont des qualités qui vous décrivent,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une bonne capacité d’analyse, de synthèse et de rédaction et parlez couramment anglais (oral et écrit),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La connaissance de base des systèmes d&#39;exploitation Linux, de l&#39;administration système, de tous les langages OO et expérience SDLC est un plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Horizon is an equal opportunity employer. We promote diversity, multiculturalism, and inclusion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Product team defines how millions of people experience Deliveroo, turning complex marketplace challenges into simple, high-impact solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of data, design and engineering, we set direction, prioritise what matters most, and deliver outcomes that move the business forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our London team. In this role, you’ll help us expand our on-demand grocery and retail offering, building a trusted shopping experience that customers rely on for their everyday local commerce needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the New Verticals team. New Verticals is Deliveroo’s business for on-demand grocery and retail: expanding what customers can buy on Deliveroo beyond restaurants, from everyday essentials to products from well-known brands and local stores. It’s a key growth area for the company, focused on building a trusted, repeatable shopping experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own high-impact growth problems end-to-end, identifying opportunities across the customer lifecycle—from acquisition and activation to retention and monetisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead cross-functional teams across Engineering, Data Science, Design, and Commercial to align on priorities and drive execution from concept to launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Customer Research to uncover barriers to transaction and translate those insights into high-conviction growth bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and run controlled experiments to understand how affordability and selection influence behaviour, validating hypotheses through data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive alignment and trade-offs by balancing customer experience with unit economics and marketplace dynamics, communicating clearly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to solve complex problems, with a knack for asking the right questions and translating ambiguity into actionable roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High analytical fluency and significant experience being data-savvy, with the ability to diagnose performance drivers and partner effectively with Data Science.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ownership of high-velocity execution, maintaining a sharp eye for detail in an environment where impact is paramount.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with experience navigating trade-offs across diverse disciplines like Marketing, Operations, and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A growth mindset and the resilience to learn fast, adapt to failures, and keep moving forward in a highly experimental environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead a high-stakes team of Product Managers responsible for successful delivery and integration of Scale products into complex customer environments. Own the feedback loop that converts bespoke field wins into scalable, repeatable product strategy, partnering deeply with Sales/GTM and EPD (Eng/Product/Design).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, mentor, and deploy PMs across strategic accounts (e.g., Fortune 100, government).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns across deployments; decide which bespoke solutions should move from custom to core product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary product partner to Sales/GTM leadership to align roadmap with market demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic + technical oversight to unblock high-priority deployments in “red zones.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the voice of the field within internal EPD teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product leadership, including 4+ years managing Product Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in forward-deployed models or top-tier technical consulting / implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High technical IQ: comfort with APIs, data pipelines, SQL; understands how data quality affects model performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extreme ownership + systems thinking; navigates complex stakeholder landscapes from engineers to C-suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at ----- Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Data Engineer Confirmé.e&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L&#39;équipe Core Data Product de DECATHLON recherche ses futur-e-s Data Engineers basé·e·s à Lille/Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Au cœur de l’entité Decathlon Digital, nous recherchons nos futur.es Data Engineers pour rejoindre les équipes Core Data Products.&lt;br&gt;Rejoignez l&#39;équipe Core Data Products : Au cœur des décisions stratégiques de Decathlon&lt;br&gt;Au sein de notre Data Platform, vous évoluerez sur le socle qui alimente l&#39;ensemble des décisions stratégiques et des modèles d&#39;IA de Decathlon. Notre mission ? Construire la Single Source of Truth transversale pour transformer les données brutes en produits de données prêts à l&#39;emploi (Gold layer), fiables et normés. Du design produit à la supply chain, en passant par l&#39;éco-conception et l&#39;expérience client, nos Core Data Products permettent à chaque équipe métier d&#39;opérer avec agilité tout en propulsant des business models circulaires, rentables et responsables.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton futur terrain de jeu&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Les Core Data Products sont organisés en équipes expertes, chacune pilotée par un binôme Tech Lead &amp;amp; Product Manager. Selon ton profil et tes affinités, tu intégreras l’un de nos collectifs :&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;🔍 Équipe FOUNDATIONS&lt;br&gt;Relier les ressources de l&#39;entreprise, sa santé financière et l&#39;excellence opérationnelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔍 Équipe PLANET &amp;amp; PRODUCT OFFER&lt;br&gt;Une source unique de vérité qui fait le lien entre la conception des produits et l&#39;expérience de l&#39;offre.&lt;br&gt;Mesurer l&#39;impact de chaque décision sur l&#39;humain et la planète pour propulser des modèles d&#39;entreprise circulaires, rentables et responsables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔍 Équipe INDUSTRY SUPPLY INVENTORY&lt;br&gt;Unifier les données de la chaîne d&#39;approvisionnement grâce à des produits de données prêts à évoluer à grande échelle. Alimenter Decathlon : du fournisseur jusqu&#39;à la livraison.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔍 Équipe SALES &amp;amp; PRICE&lt;br&gt;Grâce à notre source unique de vérité sur les données de ventes et de prix, nous permettons aux équipes métiers de prendre les meilleures décisions afin d&#39;accroître la croissance et la rentabilité de Decathlon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔍 Équipe &amp;nbsp;USER &amp;amp; CUSTOMER INTERACTIONS&lt;br&gt;Permettre à chaque collaborateur chez Decathlon de comprendre les interactions des utilisateurs et clients avec Decathlon, ses services et ses produits, afin de générer les informations nécessaires à la gestion et à la prise de décision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tes responsabilités comprendront () :&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Stratégie Technique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l&#39;élaboration de la stratégie de nos stacks techniques et garantir la CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenir et repenser les datasets et pipelines existants pour servir une plus large variété de use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir, développer et industrialiser des modèles de données complexes pour permettre l&#39;analyse des usages, de la qualité et de la maturité de notre patrimoine de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise &amp;amp; Accompagnement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compréhension des besoins fonctionnels :&lt;/strong&gt; Proactivité dans l’analyse du besoin et la compréhension du quotidien des utilisateurs qu’on accompagne et de leurs stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support et accompagnement :&lt;/strong&gt; Agir en tant qu&#39;expert pour guider les équipes data dans l&#39;utilisation correcte et efficace de nos produits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuer activement&lt;/strong&gt; à notre communauté de data engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Engineering &amp;amp; Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promotion des bonnes pratiques :&lt;/strong&gt; Contribuer activement à l&#39;amélioration continue de nos méthodes de travail (mob programming, TDD, documentation robuste...) pour élever les standards techniques de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellence opérationnelle :&lt;/strong&gt; Mettre en œuvre des solutions de monitoring et d&#39;automatisation pour réduire considérablement la charge de travail manuelle et améliorer l&#39;efficacité globale de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Web Services S3, Glue, EMR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks, Unity Catalog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apache Spark (PySpark)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ordonnancement avec Airflow (Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Source framework : Great expectations, Open Lineage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Github&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maîtrise Technique :&lt;/strong&gt; Une expertise confirmée en SQL et Python (PySpark) pour manipuler et optimiser des volumes de données massifs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture Cloud :&lt;/strong&gt; Une expérience solide sur Databricks, EMR et Airflow. Tu sais choisir les bons outils pour les bons patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Data :&lt;/strong&gt; Une compréhension profonde de la modélisation (Kimball, OBT) et des concepts critiques (Lineage, Gouvernance, Data Contracts).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Collaboratif :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu as l&#39;habitude des environnements agiles (Pair/Mob programming, Code Reviews) et tu sais documenter ton travail pour le rendre pérenne.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Un excellent relationnel pour fédérer autour de tes solutions. Ton anglais est fluide pour évoluer dans notre contexte international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 jours de télétravail par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibilité de travailler dans l&#39;un des bureaux de Decathlon Digital à Lille ou Paris ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel performant fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows, ou Chromebooks) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, certifications techniques dès la première année, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise, &lt;strong&gt;bonus&lt;/strong&gt; mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming&amp;nbsp;organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting&amp;nbsp;with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible&lt;br&gt;business impact.&lt;br&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work&amp;nbsp;with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is&amp;nbsp;at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic&amp;nbsp;challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and&amp;nbsp;new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Manager who leads strategy and architecture projects focused on GenAI solutions. You will own the design of architectures and solutions end to end, balancing business value, technology choices and economics across every dimension of the decision.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will lead development teams, present solutions to C-level stakeholders and run technical and strategic workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Project and programme leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead strategy and architecture projects on GenAI, from scoping and business case through to solution design and rollout oversight.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own project plans, budgets, risks and quality, ensuring delivery against client objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Shape proposals, estimates and demos, and identify follow-on opportunities with clients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architecture and solution design&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design GenAI architectures and solutions: RAG, agentic systems, multi-agent orchestration, MCP and A2A integration, copilots and assistants.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Select and combine cloud-native AI services (e.g. Azure AI Foundry, Copilot Studio, Vertex AI, Bedrock, Databricks) with third-party and custom components.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Apply GenAI to support functions such as HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance and IT, redesigning processes and operating models around the new solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cross-dimension optimization and trade-offs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Orchestrate decisions across make, buy and customization options, weighing capex against opex and total cost of ownership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assess the impact of tool and architecture choices on vendor lock-in, performance, latency, scalability, security and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate these trade-offs into clear recommendations that business and IT leaders can act on.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Team and stakeholder leadership&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Guide development teams technically: set the architecture, review solutions and unblock delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Present solutions and recommendations to C-level audiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Run technical and strategic workshops independently, from discovery to design and prioritization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coach and develop consultants and architects in the team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 8 years of professional experience in IT.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 3 years on AI/GenAI architecture and solution design projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior hands-on background as an engineer or developer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience applying GenAI to support functions (HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance or IT).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Consulting experience, ideally in strategy consulting, combined with experience at a system integrator or delivery firm.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track record of managing projects and leading teams, including development teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience presenting to C-level stakeholders and running workshops independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical and functional skills:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;GenAI architectures: RAG, agentic and multi-agent patterns, LLMOps, model evaluation, guardrails and responsible AI.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Agent protocols and copilots: MCP, A2A, Microsoft Copilot and Copilot Studio, custom assistants and their integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud AI platforms: Azure AI Foundry, Vertex AI, Bedrock, Databricks and the native data and AI services of Azure, AWS and GCP.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Architecture trade-offs: make vs buy vs customize, capex vs opex, TCO, lock-in, performance, latency, scalability, security and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support functions: processes and operating models in HR, Procurement, Legal, Finance and IT, and how GenAI changes them.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Delivery leadership: agile methods, technical team guidance, solution review, programme governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Business: business cases, value tracking, and the ability to translate technical choices into economic impact for executives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;German not strictly required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud or AI certifications (e.g. Azure AI Engineer, Azure Solutions Architect, AWS Machine Learning).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A leadership role bridging strategy, architecture and GenAI delivery, with direct impact on client decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;International projects on GenAI, agentic systems and support function transformation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A growth path towards senior programme and practice leadership roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Location and working model: (Hybrid) Zurich or Lausanne.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don’t worry if you don’t meet all the criteria! We value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. We’d love to hear from you and learn more about your passion for driving the AI revolution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

